[21.757413, "o", "public: local integrity verified (T1/T2/T4); 1 tail(s); all events are signature-covered; 1 \r\nbackup key(s), which sign nothing until restored (informational, not a break; --verbose names \r\nthe key); external witness (T3): not covered, nothing outside this machine attests this record\r\n"]
